flowchart TD
    SRV[apps/server in-process consumer]
    SRV -->|sendToQueue protobuf Message| Q1[queue netops-smpp]
    Q1 -->|basic_consume smpp_consumer| SC[StreamConsumer delegate]
    SC --> MP[MessageProcessor process_stream_entry]
    MP --> DE[deserialize_message prost decode]
    DE --> TX[mpsc send_tx capacity 100]
    TX --> RL[run_listener connected loop]
    RL --> LK[lookup preflight_check when SMS_LOOKUP_API_KEY set]
    LK --> DS[do_send builds SubmitSm]
    DS -->|submit_sm registered_delivery request_all| SMSC[SMSC]

    SMSC -->|deliver_sm / DLR| EV[Event Incoming DeliverSm]
    EV --> INC[Incoming from_event]
    INC --> MSG[Message status RECEIVED source smpp-server]
    MSG --> PUB[basic_publish exchange smpp rk to_nodejs]
    DS -.->|status SENDING| PUB
    MP -.->|status SENT| PUB
    RL -.->|status FAILED plus error_reason| PUB
    PUB --> Q2[queue to_nodejs]
    Q2 --> NODE[apps/server setupReceiveChannel]
    NODE --> PG[Postgres message, message_smpp, message_status_history]
    NODE --> WS[WebSocket topic smpp]
